    "detailed_description": "To join pre-alpha and get a key join our  by clicking image below. :)<br><br><br><br><br>Bonk Battle Royal is an action-packed multiplayer game that lets you take on a role of a predator or prey in a natural setting. You'll be competing against others who share the same objective - survival and dominance. But there's a catch! The forest is overseen by an invisible curator who rewards players with victory points for chasing and consuming opponents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hide and seek</strong></h2>To win the game, you must find other players and attack them. However, you have the freedom to employ different strategies to achieve your goal. When an animal runs out of health, the curator revives them as a different species, and the cycle continues. <br>You can try to be invisible while being in the middle of an action: behave naturally, try to be one with the nature.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916670/extras/51849fb6f89c4b53f4f91ab54c44645e.poster.avif?t=1739872218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916670/extras/51849fb6f89c4b53f4f91ab54c44645e.webm?t=1739872218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916670/extras/51849fb6f89c4b53f4f91ab54c44645e.mp4?t=1739872218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Try different game modes:</strong></h2>Go solo and dominate the forest as an alpha-predator or team up with up to 4 friends to become a gigachad pack of your dream.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique animimals</strong></h2>Every anymal in a game is special. Every one has abilities and movements that suites for a kind: wolf can dash, deer can jump high, etc.<br><br>Overall, AUF Battle Royal is an exciting game that promises an immersive experience as you navigate the natural environment and vie for supremacy.<br><br>Learn more or if you want to participate in early game development process, join our ",
